// The habit editor. Habits draws it and its practice picker
// (apps/habits/habit_edit_view.zi); this host keeps the habit being edited,
// gives it to the editor each frame with its questions and the practices it
// can link, keeps what the editor changed, and saves, deletes or asks before
// leaving through the same rules as before.
